    <!-- Long Text -->
    <string name="long_text">Uikit is a universal UI component library designed for Android and Wear OS. It is rendered completely in pure Java and has zero AndroidX dependencies. Inheriting core features from WatchSend, the UI is deeply optimized for round and small screens. If you encounter any issues, please visit the open-source repository: https://github.com/styisme/wear-uikit. We look forward to your Stars and Issues!</string>

